# Before working on any feature or fix, read (preference)

Standing user preference: Before working on any feature or fix, read all implementation plans up to the current version, walk every logic path, inspect every interface, and understand the full codebase rather than reasoning from a partial view.

## Conventions
- Before working on any feature or fix, read all implementation plans up to the current version, walk every logic path, inspect every interface, and understand the full codebase rather than reasoning from a partial view.

